## Construcción Windows

### Toolchain CMake

Usar LLVM-MinGW UCRT, `CMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME Windows`, arquitectura x86_64, compiladores `x86_64-w64-mingw32-clang` y `clang++`, y `x86_64-w64-mingw32-windres`.

Crear la import library Vulkan con:

```bash
llvm-dlltool -m i386:x86-64 -d vulkan-1.def \
  -l libvulkan-1.dll.a -D vulkan-1.dll
```

### Motor CPU

Configurar whisper.cpp con:

```text
CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release
C flags: -O3 -DNDEBUG